{"seq":1,"slug":"bol-three-legal-functions-transferability","title":"提单三大法律功能与可转让性建模（收据/运输合同/物权凭证）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/electronic-bill-of-lading-trade-document-digitization/bill-of-lading-legal-electronic-model/bol-three-legal-functions-transferability","wordCount":3182,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"提单三大法律功能与可转让性建模-收据-运输合同-物权凭证\">提单三大法律功能与可转让性建模（收据/运输合同/物权凭证）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>提单（Bill of Lading，B/L）不是一张&quot;运输单据&quot;，而是一组法律关系的载体。同一份纸质文件同时承担三项功能，而这三项功能的成立条件、流通规则和失效时点各不相同。电子提单（electronic Bill of Lading，eBL）工程的绝大多数难点，恰恰来自把三项功能混为一谈：平台能把数据字段结构化，却未必能让&quot;物权凭证&quot;这一功能在数字环境下成立。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>法律性质</th>\n<th>谁依赖它</th>\n<th>成立时点</th>\n<th>转让后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>货物收据（receipt）</td>\n<td>证据性</td>\n<td>收货人、保险人、银行</td>\n<td>货物装船后签发</td>\n<td>初步证据，可被反证推翻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运输合同证明</td>\n<td>证据性</td>\n<td>托运人、承运人</td>\n<td>订舱即成立，提单为其证明</td>\n<td>受让人取得合同项下权利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物权凭证（document of title）</td>\n<td>权利性</td>\n<td>银行、买方、承运人</td>\n<td>凭单放货惯例 + 成文法</td>\n<td>交付提单 = 拟制交付货物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区别在于前两项是<strong>证据性</strong>的（evidentiary），第三项是<strong>权利性</strong>的（constitutive）。证据性功能可以用数据库记录加电子签名替代，只要可读、可验、不可否认；权利性功能则要求法律承认&quot;控制该电子记录&quot;在法律效果上等同于&quot;占有该纸质单据&quot;，否则银行不会接受它作押汇担保，承运人也不敢凭它放货。因此 eBL 的历史是一段制度史而非技术史。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[货物装船] --&gt; B[签发提单]&#10;    B --&gt; C{三项功能}&#10;    C --&gt; D[货物收据&lt;br/&gt;初步证据]&#10;    C --&gt; E[运输合同证明]&#10;    C --&gt; F[物权凭证&lt;br/&gt;凭单放货]&#10;    F --&gt; G[背书转让]&#10;    G --&gt; H[银行押汇/开证]&#10;    H --&gt; I[凭单提货]&#10;    F -.电子化瓶颈.-&gt; J[控制权 vs 占有权]\">graph TD\n    A[货物装船] --&gt; B[签发提单]\n    B --&gt; C{三项功能}\n    C --&gt; D[货物收据&lt;br/&gt;初步证据]\n    C --&gt; E[运输合同证明]\n    C --&gt; F[物权凭证&lt;br/&gt;凭单放货]\n    F --&gt; G[背书转让]\n    G --&gt; H[银行押汇/开证]\n    H --&gt; I[凭单提货]\n    F -.电子化瓶颈.-&gt; J[控制权 vs 占有权]</pre><h2 id=\"三功能的证据法基础-收据与运输合同\">三功能的证据法基础：收据与运输合同</h2><p>收据功能的核心是一条证据法规则：<strong>提单是承运人收到货物的初步证据（prima facie evidence）</strong>。英国 1855 年《提单法》确立了转让提单可转让合同权利；1992 年《海上货物运输法》（COGSA 1992）取代前者，把&quot;合法提单持有人取得运输合同项下全部权利&quot;从&quot;货物所有权随提单转移&quot;这一古老限制中解放出来。</p>\n<p>收据规则分两类：对托运人，提单通常只是初步证据，承运人可举证证明实际收货状态与记载不符（例如货物装载时已有瑕疵而提单为清洁提单）；对善意受让人（indorsee），在若干法域下承运人<strong>不得</strong>以提单记载之外的事实对抗该第三人（禁反言 estoppel）——如果 eBL 平台的审计日志能证明受让人&quot;知悉&quot;某项不符，这项保护可能落空。</p>\n<p>运输合同功能有时点错位：合同在<strong>订舱</strong>时即已成立，提单只是<strong>证明</strong>其条款并在受让后发生权利转让。因此字段模型上，合同当事人、运费条款、责任限制来自订舱数据，而提单号、装船日期、货物描述、收货人指示来自签发数据；把两者合成一张扁平表会导致后续责任认定无法回溯。</p>\n<p>收据与运输合同都可完全数据化，只要满足三条件——内容可完整读取、签署可归属到主体、记录不可被单方事后篡改；这三条正是电子签名与不可否认性框架覆盖的范围，无需专门立法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物权凭证功能的瓶颈-占有权无法在数字环境自然成立\">物权凭证功能的瓶颈：占有权无法在数字环境自然成立</h2><p>普通法传统中，&quot;document of title&quot;是功能定义而非文件定义：任何单据，如果<strong>商业惯例把它视为货物权利的象征</strong>，且<strong>凭其交付即可转移该权利</strong>，它就是物权凭证。提单获得这一地位，靠的是数百年的凭单放货惯例，以及成文法（如英国《1889 年代理法》Factors Act 1889 与后续判例）的确认。</p>\n<p>这一功能依赖一个物理前提：<strong>单据是唯一可占有的载体</strong>。占有权（possession）要求&quot;排他控制一份有体物&quot;，而电子记录默认可以无限复制、瞬时传播、无法物理占有，因此在传统法律下天然不构成&quot;物权凭证&quot;——这就是 eBL 半个世纪未能普及的根本原因。设纸质路径的权利转移算子是&quot;交付占有&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mtext>Delivery</mtext><mo>≡</mo><mtext>Indorsement</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Physical Transfer</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{paper}: \\text{Delivery} \\equiv \\text{Indorsement} + \\text{Physical Transfer}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Delivery</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Indorsement</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Physical Transfer</span></span></span></span></span></span>；数字路径要让同一权利效果成立，必须定义新算子，使它在法律效果上唯一对应纸质交付：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mtext>Control</mtext><mo>≡</mo><mtext>Singleness</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Exclusive Control</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Transfer</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Integrity</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{electronic}: \\text{Control} \\equiv \\text{Singleness} + \\text{Exclusive Control} + \\text{Transfer} + \\text{Integrity}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Control</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Singleness</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Exclusive Control</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Transfer</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Integrity</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即&quot;控制权&quot;必须满足单一性、排他性、可完整转让、内容完整四项，法律才承认它等价于&quot;占有&quot;——任何 eBL 平台的架构，本质都是在实现这几个可验证属性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"制度演进-从-cmi-电子提单规则到-mletr\">制度演进：从 CMI 电子提单规则到 MLETR</h2><p>eBL 的制度史可按&quot;用什么机制替代占有&quot;划分四代。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代际</th>\n<th>代表方案</th>\n<th>替代占有的机制</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一代</td>\n<td>CMI Rules for Electronic Bills of Lading（1990）</td>\n<td>私法合同：约定以 PIN 码传递控制</td>\n<td>只约束签约方，对银行/保险人无约束力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二代</td>\n<td>Bolero / @GlobalTrade（1990s）</td>\n<td>会员合同 + 中央登记处记录持有人</td>\n<td>需合同链条，网络效应强，扩展慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三代</td>\n<td>essDOCS / CargoDocs 等云平台</td>\n<td>平台规则 + 集中控制</td>\n<td>仍属合同法路径，跨法域可执行性依赖合同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四代</td>\n<td>基于 MLETR 的立法承认（2017 起）</td>\n<td>成文法承认&quot;控制&quot; = &quot;占有&quot;</td>\n<td>各国采纳进度不一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一代 CMI 规则的效力来自<strong>合同相对性</strong>——只有签约方受约束，信用证项下的开证行、保兑行、保险人若不在其中，权利链条即断裂；第二代 Bolero 用中央登记处缓解这一点，但要求所有参与者加入同一合同网络。</p>\n<p>转折点是 MLETR。联合国国际贸易法委员会（UNCITRAL）2017 年通过《电子可转让记录示范法》，核心是两个条款：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>等效原则</strong>：只要电子记录满足&quot;单一性 + 控制 + 完整性&quot;三要件，法律即赋予其与可转让纸质单据相同的效力。</li>\n<li><strong>技术中立</strong>：不对实现技术设限——登记处、令牌、分布式账本都可以，只要满足功能要件。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>MLETR 让 eBL 从&quot;合同路径&quot;走向&quot;法律路径&quot;，无需各方加入同一私法网络。落地两例：英国《2023 年电子贸易单据法》（ETDA，2023 年 9 月 20 日生效）赋予电子贸易单据与纸质单据同等地位，覆盖提单、汇票、本票、仓单等；新加坡通过《电子交易法》修正（2021 年）采纳 MLETR 模式。UNCITRAL 2023 年 9 月又通过《可转让货物单证公约》，生效状态以官方公告为准。后果是：<strong>平台不再需要自建合同网络来产生物权凭证效力</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可转让性建模-单一性-控制与完整性三要件\">可转让性建模：单一性、控制与完整性三要件</h2><p><strong>单一性（Singleness）</strong>：记录在任一时刻只有一个权威版本，且任何变更都不产生第二个有效版本。纸质提单靠物理唯一性天然满足；电子记录必须靠机制保证，有两条路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>登记处路线</strong>：由可信中央登记簿记录当前&quot;控制人&quot;（controller），转让即更新登记记录（Bolero、essDOCS 及若干 MLETR 平台）。实现简单、审计清晰，但登记处成为信任中心。</li>\n<li><strong>令牌化路线</strong>：以可转让凭证（如区块链上的唯一令牌）承载控制权，转让即令牌所有权转移，单一性由账本共识保证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两条路线都合法，MLETR 明确技术中立。选择依据是场景：参与方主要是既有贸易链时，登记处契合度更高；需要跨链或开放式转让时，令牌路线的可组合性更好。</p>\n<p><strong>控制（Control）</strong>：法律上的&quot;control&quot;是可操作定义——某人能<strong>排他地</strong>主张处分权，且主张可被第三方验证；控制权归属由系统状态确定，而非由谁手里拿着纸决定。</p>\n<p><strong>完整性（Integrity）</strong>：记录内容自签发后完整且未被篡改。注意 MLETR 的完整性是<strong>动态</strong>概念——它允许流转中追加背书、修改收货人指示，只要变更可追溯、最终记录可还原完整合同内容；完全不可变的记录反而不满足提单背书流转的实务需求。</p>\n<p>用一个状态模型同时表达三要件。设状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = (C, H, I)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为当前控制人，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 为流转历史，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 为内容哈希链。一次合法转让是从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(C_1, H_1, I_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(C_2, H_2, I_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的转换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>transfer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>payload</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2 \\neq C_1,\\quad H_2 = H_1 \\cup \\{\\text{transfer}(C_1 \\to C_2, t)\\},\\quad I_2 = \\text{Hash}(I_1 \\,\\|\\, \\text{payload}_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span cl